#: docs/zh/guides/configuration.md:8
msgid "配置"
msgstr "Configuration"

#: docs/zh/guides/configuration.md:10
msgid ""
"先选择与编译 profile 匹配的预设，补充应用参数，再调用 `xgl_config_validate()` 和 "
"`xgl_memory_requirements()`，最后准备存储。预设只是初始容量组合，不代表已测量的 MCU RAM 占用。"
msgstr ""
"Start with a preset compatible with the compiled profile, fill in application details, then call "
"`xgl_config_validate()` and `xgl_memory_requirements()` before allocating storage. Presets are starting "
"capacities, not measured MCU RAM guarantees."

#: docs/zh/guides/configuration.md:12
msgid ""
"`xgl_config_get_default()` 在 Boot 档使用 Boot 预设；其余 profile 使用 Medium 模板，并将 `protocol.window_size` "
"限制为已编译的窗口容量。具名预设和 `XGL_CONFIG_PRESET_*` 宏保留各自的固定模板，不会自动缩小窗口或其他容量。例如，窗口容量为一的构建可以使用默认配置，但 Tiny "
"的窗口模板仍为二，需要显式调整后再校验。"
msgstr ""
"`xgl_config_get_default()` uses the Boot preset in a Boot build. Other profiles use the Medium template "
"and limit `protocol.window_size` to the compiled window capacity. Named presets and "
"`XGL_CONFIG_PRESET_*` macros retain their fixed templates without automatically reducing windows or "
"other capacities. For example, a build with window capacity one can use the default configuration, while"
" Tiny still has a window template of two and needs explicit adjustment before validation."

#: docs/zh/guides/configuration.md:14
msgid "生命周期和身份"
msgstr "Lifetime and Identity"

#: docs/zh/guides/configuration.md:16
msgid ""
"实例借用不可变的 `xgl_config_t`，直到 `xgl_destroy()`。其路由数组、PHY 描述符、分配器服务、认证 "
"provider、名称和回调上下文也必须持续有效。创建后不得修改配置，也不能让配置与 workspace 重叠。"
msgstr ""
"The instance borrows the immutable `xgl_config_t` until `xgl_destroy()`. Keep its route array, PHY "
"descriptors, allocator service, authentication provider, name, and callback contexts alive as well. Do "
"not change configuration after creation or overlap it with the workspace."

#: docs/zh/guides/configuration.md:18
msgid ""
"`source_id` 必须非零且不同于 `XGL_BROADCAST_ID`。路由决定可达目标。接收应用数据需要接收处理函数；`rx_accept_callback` 优先于返回 void 的旧式 "
"`rx_callback`。"
msgstr ""
"Set a nonzero `source_id` other than `XGL_BROADCAST_ID`. Routes determine reachable destinations. A "
"receive handler is needed to consume application data; `rx_accept_callback` takes precedence over the "
"legacy void `rx_callback`."

