msgid "`phy`"
msgstr "`phy`"

#: docs/zh/guides/configuration.md:0
msgid "借用的同步 TX、非阻塞 RX 回调"
msgstr "Borrowed synchronous TX and nonblocking RX callbacks"

#: docs/zh/guides/configuration.md:0
msgid "`max_frame_size`"
msgstr "`max_frame_size`"

#: docs/zh/guides/configuration.md:0
msgid "此路由允许的完整序列化帧上限"
msgstr "Complete serialized frame limit for this route"

#: docs/zh/guides/configuration.md:0
msgid "`read_freq_hz`"
msgstr "`read_freq_hz`"

#: docs/zh/guides/configuration.md:0
msgid "owner 调度时的读取频率提示，不创建定时器或任务"
msgstr "Owner-driven read frequency hint; creates no timer or task"

#: docs/zh/guides/configuration.md:0
msgid "`metric`"
msgstr "`metric`"

#: docs/zh/guides/configuration.md:0
msgid "保留的度量字段，当前不参与路径选择"
msgstr "Reserved metric; not currently used for path selection"

#: docs/zh/guides/configuration.md:30
msgid "路由容量在初始化时固定。共享同一 PHY 描述符的路由共享 parser/link；不同 PHY 描述符拥有独立 RX 状态。"
msgstr ""
"Routes have fixed capacity established at initialization. Routes sharing the same PHY descriptor share a"
" parser/link; distinct PHY descriptors have independent RX state."

#: docs/zh/guides/configuration.md:32
msgid "实际轮询还受 step 调用频率、字节预算及回调时长约束。同一 PHY 使用共享路由中的最高频率提示；协议不能保证调度器未提供的吞吐量。"
msgstr ""
"Actual polling also depends on step frequency, byte limits and callback duration. A shared PHY uses the "
"highest frequency hint among its routes; the protocol cannot guarantee throughput that the scheduler "
"does not provide."

#: docs/zh/guides/configuration.md:34
msgid ""
"临时 PHY 读取块通过 CMake 的 `XGL_DATALINK_RX_CHUNK_SIZE` 选择：AUTO 默认 Boot 为 32，其余为 128，也支持显式 16/32/64/128，例如 "
"`-DXGL_DATALINK_RX_CHUNK_SIZE=64`。它限制每次读取的栈缓冲，不改变 MTU 或持久 RX 空间。实际值写入生成的配置头；不得给已安装库的消费方注入冲突宏。吞吐与超时的配合见 "
"[Datalink](../explanation/datalink.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Select the temporary PHY read chunk through CMake `XGL_DATALINK_RX_CHUNK_SIZE`: AUTO defaults to 32 for "
"Boot and 128 elsewhere, with explicit 16/32/64/128 also supported, for example "
"`-DXGL_DATALINK_RX_CHUNK_SIZE=64`. It bounds the per-read stack buffer without changing MTU or "
"persistent RX storage. The generated header records the actual value; consumers of an installed library "
"cannot inject a conflicting macro. See [Datalink](../explanation/datalink.md) for throughput and timeout"
" considerations."

#: docs/zh/guides/configuration.md:36
msgid ""
"实际帧必须同时满足协议上限和路由 MTU，包括 24 字节基础头、扩展、payload、启用认证时的 tag 和 2 字节 CRC。`memory.rx_buffer_size` 至少为 "
"`protocol.max_frame_size`。"
msgstr ""
"The effective frame must fit the configured protocol limit and route MTU, including the 24-byte base "
"header, extensions, payload, authentication tag if enabled, and 2-byte CRC. `memory.rx_buffer_size` must"
" be at least `protocol.max_frame_size`."

#: docs/zh/guides/configuration.md:38
msgid ""
"生产 SDK 的 `XGL_DATALINK_MAX_FRAME_SIZE` 默认 2048 字节，可在构建库时通过同名 CMake 选项在 64–2048 字节之间选择。实例 MTU 必须处于 64 "
"字节与所选上限之间。单条路由可以声明更大的物理 MTU，发送时两项限制同时生效。`xgl_config_get_default()` 会约束默认 MTU，使用具名 preset 时应检查并调整 "
"`protocol.max_frame_size`。接收存储设为同一 MTU 可避免额外预留。涉及可靠通信时同时检查[反向反馈预算](../reference/protocol/v1/routing.md)。"
msgstr ""
"The producer CMake option `XGL_DATALINK_MAX_FRAME_SIZE` selects a ceiling of 64–2048 bytes, defaulting "
"to 2048. The instance MTU must be between 64 bytes and that ceiling. A route may declare a larger "
"physical MTU. Both limits apply on send. `xgl_config_get_default()` fits its default MTU to the ceiling."
" After choosing a named preset, check and adjust `protocol.max_frame_size` for the build. Setting the RX"
" storage to the same MTU avoids extra reservation. For reliable traffic, also check the [reverse "
"feedback budget](../reference/protocol/v1/routing.md)."

