#: docs/zh/guides/configuration.md:49
msgid ""
"启用的容量必须显式给出；零不表示无限制。peer 和 TX 包容量必须非零。窗口大于一时，乱序容量必须非零。关闭的可选资源可以为零。全局 TX 预算可以小于 `max_peers * "
"window_size`，此时更早出现背压。"
msgstr ""
"Enabled capacities are explicit; zero does not mean unlimited. Peer and TX packet capacities must be "
"nonzero. Window sizes above one require nonzero out-of-order capacity. Disabled optional resources can "
"remain zero. A smaller global TX budget than `max_peers * window_size` is valid and causes earlier "
"backpressure."

#: docs/zh/guides/configuration.md:51
msgid ""
"workspace 为各类包预留固定大小的槽位。需要减少预留 RAM 时，重新核算完整帧上限和各资源的槽位数量。参见[资源模型](../explanation/resource-model.md)。"
msgstr ""
"The workspace reserves fixed-size packet and payload slots according to these capacities and the "
"configured MTU. See [Resource Model](../explanation/resource-model.md)."

#: docs/zh/guides/configuration.md:53
msgid ""
"显式编译 `XGL_ENABLE_ADVANCED_RUNTIME=ON` 后，可通过独立版本化描述符限制可靠发送的忙期并接收带 scope 的回调，见[扩展运行选项](advanced-"
"runtime.md)。该能力默认关闭。安装消费可要求 `advanced_runtime` 能力。"
msgstr ""
"With explicit `XGL_ENABLE_ADVANCED_RUNTIME=ON`, a separate versioned descriptor enables reliable TX "
"lifetime limits and scoped receive callbacks; see [advanced runtime options](advanced-runtime.md). "
"Default OFF retains the existing configuration ABI. Installed consumers can require the "
"`advanced_runtime` capability."

#: docs/zh/guides/configuration.md:55
msgid "认证"
msgstr "Authentication"

#: docs/zh/guides/configuration.md:57
msgid ""
"启用认证能力的 profile 要求所有非空 `auth_provider` 都包含同步 sign/verify 回调以及 `1..XGL_AUTH_TAG_MAX_LEN` 的 tag 长度，即使 "
"`auth_required` 为 false。`auth_required` 为 true 时还要求 provider 非空。无效 provider "
"在配置校验和工作区测量阶段被拒绝，创建不会先分配工作区。发送认证流量前，用 `xgl_install_security_session()` 安装可信的双向参数。"
msgstr ""
"An authentication-capable profile requires every nonnull `auth_provider` to supply synchronous "
"sign/verify callbacks and a tag length in `1..XGL_AUTH_TAG_MAX_LEN`, even when `auth_required` is false."
" When `auth_required` is true, the provider must also be nonnull. Configuration validation and workspace"
" measurement reject invalid providers, so creation does not allocate a workspace first. Install trusted "
"directional parameters with `xgl_install_security_session()` before sending authenticated traffic."

#: docs/zh/guides/configuration.md:59
msgid ""
"`auth_required` 为 true 时，`protocol.max_frame_size` 必须支持本机基本认证收发能力。校验复用 wire 编码与帧测量，检查一个普通 `ACK_RANGE` "
"的完整认证帧；它覆盖零 epoch 的基本 HELLO 和最小 DATA 所需空间。32 字节 tag 对应的当前基础门槛为 88 字节，64 字节协议上限会被前置拒绝。"
msgstr ""
"When `auth_required` is true, `protocol.max_frame_size` must support basic authenticated communication "
"by the local endpoint. Validation uses the wire encoder and frame measurement to check one complete "
"authenticated ordinary `ACK_RANGE` frame, which also covers the base HELLO and minimum DATA at epoch "
"zero. The current base threshold for a 32-byte tag is 88 bytes; a 64-byte protocol limit is rejected "
"before allocation."

#: docs/zh/guides/configuration.md:61
msgid ""
"此门槛不包含可选的 `SESSION` 和应用 `DATA_TYPE` 扩展，也不保证任意元数据组合都能发送。单条路由可以具有更小的 "
"MTU，用于转发或其他能容纳的帧；本机发送和转发仍逐帧检查真实长度。例如，协议上限为 128、路由 MTU 为 64、tag 为 32 的配置可以初始化并转发短帧，但不能通过该路由发送本机认证 "
"DATA。`auth_required` 控制本机认证收发，不为非本地转发帧增加端点认证。"
msgstr ""
"This threshold excludes optional `SESSION` and application `DATA_TYPE` extensions and does not guarantee"
" that every metadata combination can be sent. An individual route can have a smaller MTU for forwarding "
"or other frames that fit; local transmission and forwarding still check the actual length of each frame."
" For example, a protocol limit of 128, route MTU of 64, and tag length of 32 permits initialization and "
"short-frame forwarding, but cannot send local authenticated DATA over that route. `auth_required` "
"controls local authenticated communication and does not add endpoint authentication to nonlocal "
"forwarded frames."

#: docs/zh/guides/configuration.md:63
msgid "认证不要求 libc 分配器，静态 workspace 同样支持。密钥、前缀、epoch 和重启后的新鲜性由应用负责。普通报文不能建立可信会话。关闭会话后保留 nonce 域的占用记录。"
msgstr ""
"Authentication does not require a libc allocator: static workspaces support it. Session keys, prefixes, "
"epochs, and restart freshness are application responsibilities. Ordinary packets cannot create trusted "
"sessions. Closing a session preserves a nonce-domain tombstone."

#: docs/zh/guides/configuration.md:65
msgid "校验和编译 Profile"
msgstr "Validation and Build Profiles"

#: docs/zh/guides/configuration.md:67
msgid "只支持以下明确的能力组合，不提供任意 feature flag 的排列。实际启用项及容量仍由运行时配置决定，运行时配置不能恢复编译时已裁剪的能力。"
msgstr ""
"Only these explicit capability combinations are supported, rather than arbitrary feature-flag "
"permutations. Runtime configuration still selects enabled features and capacities, but cannot restore "
"capabilities removed at build time."

