#: docs/zh/guides/configuration.md:76
msgid ""
"Boot 允许一个 peer、最多一条路由、窗口一。Embedded Lite 默认使用 8 个可靠索引桶，不保留安全会话存储；适用于需要乱序缓存的直接通信端点。其他容量上限由生成的 "
"`xgl_build_config.h` 给出。"
msgstr ""
"Boot permits one peer, at most one route, and window one. Embedded Lite defaults to eight reliable-index"
" buckets and retains no security-session storage. It serves endpoints that need out-of-order buffering "
"and use plaintext endpoint traffic. The generated `xgl_build_config.h` declares the other capacity "
"limits."

#: docs/zh/guides/configuration.md:78
msgid ""
"可靠索引桶数、私有窗口容量和自适应 RTO 可以通过受控编译选项选择，默认私有窗口仍为 128 槽，自适应 RTO 默认开启。运行时配置不能扩大已编译容量。上表 ID 仅适用于全部实际资源与 profile "
"默认值一致的构建；改变资源组合、PHY 读取块或 libc fallback 会获得不同的构建身份。选项、安装消费和冲突拒绝见[构建与测试](build-and-consume.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Reliable index buckets, private window capacity and adaptive RTO can be selected through controlled "
"compiled options. Default private capacity remains 128 slots, and adaptive RTO defaults to enabled. "
"Runtime settings cannot enlarge compiled capacity. The table's IDs apply only when all resolved "
"resources match profile defaults; changing the resource combination, PHY read chunk or libc fallback "
"produces a different build identity. See [build and test](build-and-consume.md#compiled-resource-"
"options) for options, installed consumption and conflict rejection."

#: docs/zh/guides/configuration.md:80
msgid ""
"安装包导出 `xgl_PROFILE`、`xgl_BUILD_CONFIG_ID`、`xgl_RESOURCE_CONFIG_ID`、`xgl_CAPABILITIES` 和实际资源选项，目标 "
"`xgl::xgl` 同时具有对应的 profile、构建与资源身份、能力属性。消费者可用 `find_package(xgl CONFIG REQUIRED COMPONENTS reliable "
"out_of_order)` 要求能力；不支持的必需能力在配置阶段拒绝。可请求名称为 "
"`wire`、`reliable`、`authentication`、`forwarding`、`out_of_order`、`statistics`、`diagnostics` 和 "
"`advanced_runtime`。"
msgstr ""
"Installed packages export `xgl_PROFILE`, `xgl_BUILD_CONFIG_ID`, `xgl_RESOURCE_CONFIG_ID`, "
"`xgl_CAPABILITIES` and resolved resource options. Target `xgl::xgl` carries the corresponding profile, "
"build identity, resource identity and capability properties. Consumers can require capabilities with "
"`find_package(xgl CONFIG REQUIRED COMPONENTS reliable out_of_order)`; unsupported required capabilities "
"fail configuration. Requestable names are `wire`, `reliable`, `authentication`, `forwarding`, "
"`out_of_order`, `statistics`, `diagnostics`, and `advanced_runtime`."

#: docs/zh/guides/configuration.md:82
msgid ""
"压缩和 payload 加密仍是保留项，启用会被拒绝；两个 feature flag 保持 false，`compression_id` 保持零。通过 `xgl_memory_requirements()` "
"检查 workspace 算术溢出并查询依赖 ABI 的真实大小。库、CMake target 与消费者必须使用匹配的生成 profile 和资源头文件；公开 checked "
"入口使用生成的构建身份，不能硬编码默认 profile ID。"
msgstr ""
"Compression and payload encryption remain reserved and rejected; keep both feature flags false and "
"`compression_id` zero. Use `xgl_memory_requirements()` to detect workspace arithmetic overflow and query"
" the actual ABI-dependent size. The library, CMake target and consumer must use matching generated "
"profile and resource headers. Public checked entry points use the generated build identity rather than "
"hardcoded default profile IDs."
